<!doctype html>
<html lang="<%= lang %>">
<head>
  <%- include('../partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <a href="#main" class="skip-link"><%= t.nav.skipLink %></a>
  <%- include('../partials/navbar') %>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="section__label">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="page-hero__title"><%= t.legal.cookiesTitle %></h1>
        <p class="page-hero__desc"><%= t.legal.updated %></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="legal-content">
          <% if (lang === 'en') { %>
          <h2>1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
          <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you browse websites. They help remember preferences over a period of time.</p>

          <h2>2. How We Use Cookies</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> Save your interface preferences such as Dark / Light mode and language preference (ID / EN).</li>
            <li><strong>Analytical Cookies:</strong> Provide aggregated anonymous insights to optimize page performance.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>3. Managing Cookies</h2>
          <p>You can manage or clear cookies through your browser settings at any time.</p>
          <% } else { %>
          <h2>1. Apa itu Cookie?</h2>
          <p>Cookie adalah file teks kecil yang disimpan di perangkat Anda saat Anda mengunjungi situs web untuk membantu mengingat preferensi Anda.</p>

          <h2>2. Jenis Cookie yang Kami Gunakan</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Cookie Esensial:</strong> Menyimpan preferensi tampilan seperti Dark / Light mode dan pilihan bahasa (ID / EN).</li>
            <li><strong>Cookie Analitik:</strong> Membantu kami memahami bagaimana halaman diakses secara agregat dan anonim.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>3. Pengelolaan Cookie</h2>
          <p>Anda dapat mengontrol atau menghapus cookie sewaktu-waktu melalui pengaturan browser Anda.</p>
          <% } %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
  <%- include('../partials/cookie-consent') %>
  <script src="/public/script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
